{
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "a3-overview",
    "project": "dcu-monitoring"
  },
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "A3 · 运行概览",
      "description": "数据源：test4 VictoriaMetrics。缺失或无效观测留空；默认 1 小时 / 15 秒刷新。"
    },
    "duration": "1h",
    "refreshInterval": "15s",
    "variables": [
      {
        "kind": "ListVariable",
        "spec": {
          "name": "role",
          "display": {
            "name": "角色"
          },
          "defaultValue": ".*",
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "StaticListVariable",
            "spec": {
              "values": [
                {
                  "value": ".*",
                  "label": "全部"
                },
                {
                  "value": "prefill",
                  "label": "Prefill / A3-1"
                },
                {
                  "value": "decode",
                  "label": "Decode / A3-2"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "p0": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "A3 采集目标状态",
            "description": "指标含义\nPrometheus 采集目标的抓取状态：1 表示本次指标抓取成功，0 表示失败。图例区分采集 job；采集成功只证明监控端点可读取，不证明模型能够正常完成推理。\n\nY 轴单位\n状态值；1 = 本次采集成功，0 = 本次采集失败。\n\n曲线与范围\nA3 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "1 = 正常",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "up{environment=\"a3-vllm\"} and (time() - timestamp(up{environment=\"a3-vllm\"}) < 15)",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{node}} {{instance}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p1": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "完成请求速率",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧已完成请求计数在连续采集间隔内的平均增长速率，按节点/角色展示。完成包含源指标记录的各结束原因，不等于成功量；同一请求可能经过 P/D 两侧，不应把两侧直接相加当作去重请求数。\n\nY 轴单位\nreq/s；表示每秒的平均变化量。\n\n曲线与范围\nA3 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "req/s",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.requests\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p2": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Token 生成速率",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧 Token 计数在连续采集间隔内的平均增长速率，按节点/角色展示。Token 是分词器单位，不等同于字符数或请求数；不同模型或输入输出组成的吞吐不宜直接比较。输出 Token 与 Decode Token 遵循各自源指标，源无效时留空。\n\nY 轴单位\ntoken/s；表示每秒的平均变化量。\n\n曲线与范围\nA3 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "token/s",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.decode_tokens\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p3": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "首 Token 时延 TTFT",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧从请求开始到首 Token 的时延。它不等于客户端看到首字符的完整网络时延，也不同于当前仍在等待请求的最大年龄。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\nY 轴单位\n毫秒；1000 ms = 1 秒。\n\n曲线与范围\nA3 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "ms",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p50\"}) < 15)) * 1000",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p95\"}) < 15)) * 1000",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.ttft.p99\"}) < 15)) * 1000",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p4": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Token 间隔 ITL",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧相邻输出 Token 间隔的时延分布。它不是整个回答的生成时间；与按整段输出均摊的 TPOT 也可能不同。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\nY 轴单位\n毫秒；1000 ms = 1 秒。\n\n曲线与范围\nA3 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "ms",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p50\"}) < 15)) * 1000",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p95\"}) < 15)) * 1000",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.itl.p99\"}) < 15)) * 1000",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p5": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "请求总时延 E2E",
            "description": "指标含义\n服务侧请求从开始到结束的总时延。不同输入/输出长度、缓存状态和并发负载会改变分布；不能把不同阶段的 P95 相减来求网关开销。 P50/P95/P99 是窗口内样本分位数，例如 P95 表示约 95% 的观测不超过该值。分位数来自直方图桶估算，不是精确逐请求排序；不能直接平均多节点的分位数。\n\nY 轴单位\n秒。\n\n曲线与范围\nA3 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "s",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p50\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p95\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p99\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p99\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p99\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p99\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.percentiles.e2e.p99\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p6": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "运行与排队请求",
            "description": "指标含义\n当前服务侧运行中与排队中的请求数量，按角色及源状态拆线展示。它是时刻值，不是累计请求量；排队持续增加时需结合请求到达速率和完成速率判断。\n\nY 轴单位\n请求数。\n\n曲线与范围\nA3 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "请求",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.resources.queue..*\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.resources.queue..*\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.resources.queue..*\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.resources.queue..*\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"a3-vllm\",schema=\"request-metrics-v2\",path=~\"nodes.$role.resources.queue..*\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "layouts": [
      {
        "kind": "Grid",
        "spec": {
